<title>POLAND: Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in seven companies closed higher and three were flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Total turnover rose to 2.9 million zlotys from 2.7 million on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose in a 25.1-million zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
